WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.095
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with

00:00:05.095 --> 00:00:07.731
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:10.944
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:15.712
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:21.761
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening. Justify a

00:00:21.761 --> 00:00:24.576
revision using evidence from another world tradition.
